\contentsline {table}{\numberline {2.1}{\ignorespaces \textbf {Dsicretized Boundary Conditions (BC)} Boundary conditions for all of the four boundaries of the twodimensional domain $\Omega = [0,1]^2$. Each row represents one boundary and shows the continous and numerical representation of the boundary conditions given in the task. Numerical approximation was performed by using a central finite difference approach.}}{14}{table.2.1}%
